  "description": "Fluid lines that break lap times and ignite the road: the Aerostorm time-trial bike is a storm that shreds everything in its path. Studied in wind tunnels and used by professional athletes (Cassandre Beaugrand, Dorian Coninx, FDJ-Suez n professional team, to name some), this aerodynamic bike is also for triathletes seeking to gain precious power to beat records. With an aggressive stance and perfectly aligned in air currents, the gains at high speed are considerable! The handling of the carbon cockpit is perfectly in phase with speed over hilly terrain: with additional accessories such as hydration systems, the Aerostorm DRS becomes a machine capable of winning Half-Ironman competitions or XXL triathlons!",
